		"Id": "mechdef_vindicator_VND-3MC",
		"Name": "Vindicator",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Magistracy of Canopus ended up with the lion's share of the Light Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Vindicator VND-3MC. The VND-3MC is a refit of the earlier VND-2MC and retains most of that design's equipment, including the LRM-5 and XXL Engine. However, where the -2MC carries two Plasma Rifles, the -3MC swaps them for four Light Plasma Rifles instead. The same two tons of ammunition provides plenty of battlefield endurance and an extra DHS helps manage the similar waste heat from the LPRs.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_vindicator"
